---

<svg
	xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
	viewBox="0 0 16 16"
	width="16"
	height="16"
	fill="currentColor"
	role="img"
	aria-label={title}
	class:list={['inline-block align-middle shrink-0', className]}
>
